219043332106	That's a relief... I guess?
292057776139	Before matches in Network mode, explained later,\nyou'll check your opponent with this card.
292057776140	Player level shows how much\nyou've played Virtual-On.
292057776141	The more you play in any mode,\nthe higher your level goes!
